<title>UK: Iraq postpones U.N. sugar tender until Feb 28.</title>
<headline>Iraq postpones U.N. sugar tender until Feb 28.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iraq has postponed its tender to buy sugar under the U.N. oil-for-food deal until February 28, European traders said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;They and the United Nations were not ready. They just told the people (involved) that they were postponing it,&quot; said one.</p>
</text>
